<% content_for :title, "#{application_name} | Home" %>

<section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
  <div class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Rails starter kit</p>
    <h1 id="home-title">A ready application shell, not a blank generate.</h1>
    <p class="page-summary">
      This kit keeps the Rails 8 stack, accessible layout, and verification baseline so a
      new product can start from a working app instead of a generated skeleton.
    </p>
  </div>

  <aside class="page-notice" aria-labelledby="starter-status-title">
    <h2 id="starter-status-title">Starter status</h2>
    <p>
      Rename the application, write product documents, and add the first vertical slice.
      No domain workflow is included.
    </p>
  </aside>
</section>

<section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="included-title">
  <div class="page-section__heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">What is included</p>
    <h2 id="included-title">Fundamentals that later screens can inherit.</h2>
    <p>
      Future pages should reuse this shell, the existing Rails mechanisms, and the
      documented verification commands.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ol class="page-steps">
    <li class="page-step">
      <span class="page-step__number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Application shell</h3>
        <p>Skip link, landmarks, flash messages, identity-only account links, and a restrained Tailwind visual baseline.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="page-step">
      <span class="page-step__number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Hotwire stack</h3>
        <p>Server-rendered Rails with Turbo, Stimulus, import maps, Propshaft, and Tailwind CSS.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="page-step">
      <span class="page-step__number" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Verification</h3>
        <p>Minitest, a root-page system journey, RuboCop, Brakeman, and GitHub Actions CI.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="page-section page-section--split" aria-labelledby="next-step-title">
  <div class="page-next-step">
    <p class="eyebrow">Next step</p>
    <h2 id="next-step-title">Rename this kit, then add product behavior.</h2>
    <p>
      Follow the README to change the display name, Ruby module, and database identifiers
      before adding routes that belong to a specific product.
    </p>
    <span class="unavailable-action" aria-disabled="true">Product workflow is not included</span>
  </div>

  <div class="page-limitations">
    <h2>What this starter does not include</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>It does not include authorization, roles, or OAuth.</li>
      <li>It does not include a product domain model or workflow.</li>
      <li>It does not treat the generated Kamal file as an approved production plan.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
